<view class="shell"><view class="title">当地缴费标准</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><block wx:if="{{region}}"><view class="policy-region">{{region.name}}<view>{{region.referenceLabel||'当地参考标准'}}</view></view><view class="card"><view class="card-title">每年缴费档次</view><view wx:if="{{region.continuous}}" class="hint">每年1000—9000元内自选，下表为常用金额。</view><view wx:if="{{region.annualInput}}" class="hint">当地完整档次尚未核齐，需以本地缴费页面为准，不把省级金额当成本地最高档。</view><block wx:else><view class="standards-table"><view class="standard-row table-head"><view>本人每年交</view><view>正常缴费补贴</view></view><view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="annual" class="standard-row"><view>{{item.annual}}元<text wx:if="{{item.label}}">{{item.label}}档</text></view><view>{{item.subsidy}}{{item.subsidy==='未核齐'?'':'元'}}</view></view></view><view class="hint">补贴为正常年缴参考，不直接用于历史补缴。每月能领多少，还要结合年龄、已交记录和以后的缴费。</view><view wx:if="{{region.residenceRequired}}" class="hint">成都城镇居民仅可选40%、50%档，农村居民按表中档次选择；到龄趸缴金额另核。</view></block></view><view class="card"><view class="card-title">领取标准</view><view class="policy-base">基础养老金 {{region.base}}元／月</view><view class="hint">参数年份：{{region.baseYear}}年。另加你个人账户计算的金额；这不是你最终每月能领的总额。</view><view class="hint">{{region.referenceText||'按现有公开标准参考，未来调整、特殊人群及办理资格以经办核定为准。'}}</view><view wx:if="{{region.paymentNote}}" class="hint">{{region.paymentNote}}</view></view><view class="card"><view class="card-title">政策来源</view><button wx:for="{{region.sources}}" wx:key="url" class="source-link" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="copy"><view>{{item.name}}</view><text>复制原文链接 ›</text></button><button class="source-link" bindtap="documents">文件要点与完整网址 ›</button></view></block></view><tool-nav active="resident" resident-hub/>
